---

<section class="section quote" aria-label="Quote">
  <div class="site-wrap quote__inner">
    <blockquote class="quote__text">
      <p>
        You know, sometimes all you need is 20 seconds of insane courage, just literally 20 seconds of
        embarrassing bravery, and I promise you something great will come of it.
      </p>
      <footer class="quote__attr">
        <cite>— Benjamin Mee, <em>We Bought a Zoo</em></cite>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote {
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  }

  .quote__inner {
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .quote__text {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .quote__text p {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.6vw, 1.55rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .quote__attr {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .quote__attr cite {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .quote__attr em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
